import session.dl

to [perform website Farm manual instruction] {website farm instruction:instruction} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set document to state's farm's document
    set actor to document's world's player
    set actor's target to a new website farm movement target
    set result to perform website farm instruction instruction for actor in (document's world)
    set actor's status to result's message
    set document's selected to "player"

to get [the website Farm direction for key] {integer:key}:
    if (key = 265) or (key = 87):
        return 0
    if (key = 262) or (key = 68):
        return 1
    if (key = 264) or (key = 83):
        return 2
    if (key = 263) or (key = 65):
        return 3
    return -1

to [step website Farm player toward] {integer:direction} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set state's farm's document's world's player's direction to direction
    perform website Farm manual instruction (the website Farm instruction named "step") in state

to [walk website Farm player to] {website farm point:point} [adjacently] {boolean:adjacent} [following animal] {string:animal} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set document to state's farm's document
    if (website farm land at (point's x) (point's y) is unlocked in (document's world)) = false:
        notify website farm (document's world) saying "The east field opens after the second village order."
    else:
        set player to document's world's player
        set player's target's present to true
        set player's target's x to point's x
        set player's target's y to point's y
        set player's target's adjacent to adjacent
        set player's target's animal to animal
        set player's status to "Walking to the chosen square."
        set document's selected to "player"
